## Current Behavior

### ❌ This doesn't work (dependencies are externalized):
```js
{
  environments: {
    ssr: {
      build: {
        noExternal: true, // ← This has no effect
        rollupOptions: {
          input: 'virtual:my-ssr-entry'
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

### ✅ This works (dependencies are bundled):
```js
{
  ssr: {
    noExternal: true, // ← Must be at top level
  },
  environments: {
    ssr: {
      build: {
        rollupOptions: {
          input: 'virtual:my-ssr-entry'
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```



