### Describe the bug

The `config` and `configResolved` hook will be call many times when using the `vite.createBundler` API

I think it due to the environments API. But cannot fine a solution to disable it. coz when I add the below config for the vite config it will print one more times.
```json
{
   "environments": {
      "dev": {}
   }
}
````
And this is the full example I tried.
```js

import { createBuilder } from 'vite';

const build = async () => {
  let time = 0;
  const builder = await createBuilder({
    configFile: false,
    envFile: false,
    configLoader: 'bundle',
    dev: {},
    plugins: [
      {
        name: 'test-plugin',
        config: (config) => {
          console.log('test-plugin config', time);
          time++;
        },
      },
    ],
  });

  await builder.buildApp();
};

build();

```

This is the printed output when run abort script.

<img width="1016" height="388" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1ef27d9f-0d56-4068-805c-981697bd3dcf" />

And this is also can reproduce in the `vite v6` and the `rolldown-vite`, but `rolldown-vite` will print 3 times by default.

